    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrible enemy emerged from the darkness with a powerful spell that changed everything forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When chaos arose, the sky began to be covered with ash and your destiny had already marked your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, craft, explore, defeat powerful enemies, forge your own weapons, customize your equipment, complete dungeons, solve puzzles and dominate the terrain in this ambitious open world RPG focused on a retro yet innovative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to overthrow Team Prism and their leader?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What ending will you meet? Your decisions are important!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite everything, a mysterious force hides between this game and reality...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it comes to contacting you, god have mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos of Destiny is designed to play with you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It\u2019s not a glitch. It\u2019s the game protecting itself from you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monsters don\u2019t always attack. Sometimes they just watch.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survive. But don\u2019t trust reality.&quot;</p></li></ul>",
